          "question": "एक संख्या के 40% का 15%, 12 है। संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "200",
            "B": "300",
            "C": "250",
            "D": "400"
          },
          "explanation": "x * 0.40 * 0.15 = 12. x * 0.06 = 12. x = 200."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-011",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "Find the HCF of 2/3, 8/9 and 10/27.",
