        "B": "8/3",
        "C": "2/3",
        "D": "40/3"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "HCF of fractions = HCF of numerators / LCM of denominators = HCF(2,8,10) / LCM(3,9,27) = 2/27.",
      "hash": "3ba3dfa3f693404a",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "2/3, 8/9 और 10/27 का HCF ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "2/27",
            "B": "8/3",
            "C": "2/3",
            "D": "40/3"
          },
          "explanation": "भिन्नों का HCF = अंशों का HCF / हरों का LCM = HCF(2,8,10) / LCM(3,9,27) = 2/27."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-012",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "A and B can do a work in 12 days, B and C in 15 days, C and A in 20 days. In how many days can A, B and C together do it?",
      "options": {
        "A": "10 days",
        "B": "8 days",
        "C": "12 days",
        "D": "5 days"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "2(A+B+C) = 1/12 + 1/15 + 1/20 = (5+4+3)/60 = 12/60 = 1/5. (A+B+C) = 1/10. Days = 10.",
      "hash": "94ccd9a726012689",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "A और B एक काम को 12 दिनों में, B और C 15 दिनों में, C और A 20 दिनों में कर सकते हैं। A, B और C मिलकर इसे कितने दिनों में कर सकते हैं?",
          "options": {
            "A": "10 दिन",
            "B": "8 दिन",
            "C": "12 दिन",
            "D": "5 दिन"
          },
          "explanation": "2(A+B+C) = 12/60 = 1/5. (A+B+C) = 1/10. दिन = 10."
        }
      }
    },
